{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46761","headline":"楚寺寒夜作 · 齐己","name":"楚寺寒夜作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寒炉局促坐成劳，暗淡灯光照二毛。\n水寺闲来僧寂寂，雪风吹去雁嗷嗷。\n江山积叠归程远，魂梦穿沿过处高。\n毕竟忘言是吾道，袈裟不称揖萧曹。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46761.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46761","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}